  },
  "segments": [
    {"id": "B01", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.9, "text": "哒哒哒——！声音探险队，出发！"},
    {"id": "B02", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "小Q，玩具箱那两个精灵昨天刚抓到。欢呼精灵和含糖精灵，还记得吗？"},
    {"id": "X01", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "记得！玩具 toy 是哦—衣，鼻子 nose 是欧——！"},
    {"id": "B03", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "满分。今天第十站，我们回家去。先考你：你每天放学回去的那栋大房子，英文叫什么？"},
    {"id": "X03", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "house！房子！"},
    {"id": "B05", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "好，第二个：你听我说话，用的是身上哪个部位？"},
    {"id": "X04", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "耳朵！ear！"},
    {"id": "B06", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "关键问题来了：house 和 ear 中间那个音，一样吗？"},
    {"id": "X05", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "嗯……一个是「啊呜」，一个是「一呃」？不对不对，我不知道！"},
    {"id": "B07", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "你前半句就说对了！先请第一位——惊叹精灵。你走到一栋超级大的房子前面，抬头一看，脱口就是——"},
    {"id": "B07en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "ow"},
    {"id": "X06", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "啊——呜！好大好大！"},
    {"id": "B08", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "对！嘴巴从张到最大的「啊」，一路收到圆圆的「呜」，中间不能停。它就住在 house 里。跟我读——"},
    {"id": "B08en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "house."},
    {"id": "X07", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "house！房子！记住了：看到大房子，啊—呜，惊叹！"},
    {"id": "B10", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "第二位精灵最文静，它住在耳朵里。你把手指贴在耳朵边，听别人说悄悄话——"},
    {"id": "B10en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "ear"},
    {"id": "X08", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "一——呃……队长，我也想听悄悄话！"},
    {"id": "B11", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "对！从扁扁的「一」滑到轻轻的「呃」，声音小小的、贴着耳朵走。它就住在 ear 里。跟我读——"},
    {"id": "B11en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "ear."},
    {"id": "X09", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "ear！耳朵！记住了：贴着耳朵，一—呃，说悄悄话。"},
    {"id": "B12", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "两个精灵的差别就一句：惊叹精灵嘴巴往外张，从大收到小；悄悄话精灵往里收，从头到尾都小小的。来，对比三连——"},
    {"id": "B12en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.75, "text": "house. ear. house. ear. house. ear."},
    {"id": "X10", "role": "xq", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.95, "text": "house. ear. house. ear. house. ear."},
    {"id": "B14", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "漂亮！进入单词宝藏时间。第一组，惊叹精灵家的小朋友，三个都带那声「啊—呜」。每个单词先慢速，再常速，中间留给你跟读。"},
    {"id": "B16", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "第一个：房子。慢速——"},
    {"id": "B16en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "house."},
    {"id": "B17", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "house 就是房子。你读一遍——"},
    {"id": "B18", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "house."},
    {"id": "X11", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "house！我家的大 house！"},
    {"id": "B19", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "第二个：嘴。慢速——"},
    {"id": "B19en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "mouth."},
    {"id": "B20", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "mouth 是嘴巴，张得越大越好。你也来——"},
    {"id": "B21", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "mouth."},
    {"id": "X12", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "mouth！张大嘴大声读！"},
    {"id": "B22", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "第三个：奶牛。慢速——"},
    {"id": "B22en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "cow."},
    {"id": "B23", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "cow 是奶牛。跟着读——"},
    {"id": "B24", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "cow."},
    {"id": "X13", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "cow！奶牛说，啊——呜！"},
    {"id": "B25", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "第二组，悄悄话精灵家的小朋友，三个都小小的。第四个：耳朵。慢速——"},
    {"id": "B25en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "ear."},
    {"id": "B26", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "ear 就是耳朵。你读——"},
    {"id": "B27", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "ear."},
    {"id": "X14", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "ear！我的耳朵竖起来啦！"},
    {"id": "B28", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "第五个：近。慢速——"},
    {"id": "B28en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "near."},
    {"id": "B29", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "near 是近，就在旁边一点点。来——"},
    {"id": "B30", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "near."},
    {"id": "X15", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "near！你离我好 near！"},
    {"id": "B31", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "第六个，最后一个：鹿。慢速——"},
    {"id": "B31en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.6, "text": "deer."},
    {"id": "B32", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "deer 是小鹿。一起读——"},
    {"id": "B33", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.85, "text": "deer."},
    {"id": "X16", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "deer！小鹿竖着耳朵跑过来！"},
    {"id": "B34", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "六个单词全部到手！进入口诀记忆屋，拍手跟我念——"},
    {"id": "B35", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.8, "text": "大房子，啊——呜，house 大，mouth 张，奶牛 cow 站在草地上；贴耳朵，一——呃，ear 朵，在 near 处，小 deer 轻轻走过来。一个往外张，一个往里收！"},
    {"id": "X17", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.9, "text": "大房子，啊——呜，house 大，mouth 张，奶牛 cow 站在草地上；贴耳朵，一——呃，ear 朵，在 near 处，小 deer 轻轻走过来。一个往外张，一个往里收！"},
    {"id": "B36", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "满血毕业！听辨大挑战，三道题。第一题——"},
    {"id": "B36en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.7, "text": "now. near."},
    {"id": "X18", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "第一个 now 是现在！第二个 near 是近的！"},
    {"id": "B38", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "全对！第一颗星。第二题——"},
    {"id": "B38en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.7, "text": "town. tear."},
    {"id": "X19", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "太简单了！两个都是 town，城镇！"},
    {"id": "B39", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "揭晓——第二个是 tear，眼泪！把前面那个「呜」换成「呃」，城镇就变成了眼泪。"},
    {"id": "X20", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "啊——！我还以为那有两座城呢！"},
    {"id": "B40", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "错一题才记得牢。第三题，最后一题——"},
    {"id": "B40en", "role": "bobo", "lang": "en", "speed": 0.7, "text": "house. hear."},
    {"id": "X21", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "house 是房子，hear 是听见！这次我是听嘴巴大小听出来的！"},
    {"id": "B41", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "完全正确！两颗半星，收好。以后再听到这两个音，就问自己一句：这是惊叹，还是悄悄话？"},
    {"id": "X22", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "惊叹是啊—呜，悄悄话是一—呃！忘不了！"},
    {"id": "B43", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.85, "text": "今天的探险就到这里。下一站，我们去理发店，还要做一份旅行计划——那儿有两个最文静的精灵，一个藏在头发里，一个躲在行李箱里。单词不多，认识一下就行。"},
    {"id": "X23", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "理发店？要剪头发吗？我有点紧张……"},
    {"id": "B45", "role": "bobo", "lang": "zh", "speed": 0.9, "text": "声音探险队，下一站见！"},
    {"id": "X25", "role": "xq", "lang": "zh", "speed": 1.0, "text": "声音探险队，下一站见！"}
  ]
}
